{"t": 1794117138.5148787, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline #8812 on `main` (sha `a91c2e0`) is red: the `test:contract` job (#77104) fails in `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format`.\n\n**Root cause:** `billing/invoice.py` built the invoice number as `f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\"`, so sequence 42 produced `INV-2026-42`. The ERP v2 import contract (FIN-77) requires the sequence part to be zero-padded to 6 digits, i.e. `INV-2026-000042`.\n\n**Fix:** format the sequence with `:06d`:\n\n```python\ndef invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n```\n\nThis keeps the existing `INV-<year>-<seq>` layout while matching the ERP v2 fixed-width sequence field. Verified locally: `invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"`, which is the assertion from the failing contract test."}, "ok": false}
{"t": 1794117144.975497, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy", "body": "Pipeline #8812 on main (sha a91c2e0) is red: the test:contract job (#77104) fails in contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format.\n\nRoot cause: billing/invoice.py built the invoice number as f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\", so sequence 42 produced INV-2026-42. The ERP v2 import contract (FIN-77) requires the sequence part to be zero-padded to 6 digits, i.e. INV-2026-000042.\n\nFix: format the sequence with :06d:\n\n    def invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n        return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n\nThis keeps the existing INV-<year>-<seq> layout while matching the ERP v2 fixed-width sequence field. Verified locally: invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\", which is the assertion from the failing contract test."}, "ok": true}
